<title>ITALY: Air cargo rates ex-Italy.</title>
<headline>Air cargo rates ex-Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Rome air cargo rates calculated from direct and off line service for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>Destination	July 18    April 3</p>
<p>		    NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>  ROM-CHI	   2,500	2,450</p>
<p>  ROM-LAX/SFO     2,800	2,675</p>
<p>  ROM-MIA	   2,700	2,475</p>
<p>  ROM-NYC	   2,425	2,350</p>
<p>  ROM-TOR	   2,625	2,280</p>
<p>		   LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>  ROM-BUE	   5,950	5,910</p>
<p>  ROM-CCS	   4,150	3,800</p>
<p>  ROM-MEX	   3,875	3,785</p>
<p>  ROM-RIO	   5,550	5,270</p>
<p>  ROM-SCL	   6,250	5,765</p>
<p>			AFRICA</p>
<p>  ROM-JNB	   3,900	4,450</p>
<p>  ROM-NBO	   2,850	3,450</p>
<p>		    NORTH ASIA</p>
<p>  ROM-HKG	   2,900	2,775</p>
<p>  ROM-OSA	   4,750	4,950</p>
