<p>		 MIDDLE EAST/SOUTH ASIA</p>
<p>  ROM-BOM	   2,710	2,775</p>
<p>  ROM-DEL	   2,375	2,800</p>
<p>  ROM-DBX	   2,275	2,100</p>
<p>		 SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALIA</p>
<p>  ROM-AKL	   5,300	5,460</p>
<p>  ROM-BKK	   3,850	2,925</p>
<p>  ROM-SIN	   2,675	2,755</p>
<p>  ROM-SYD/MEL     5,475	5,555</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in lira per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
